ts","basic_fish","finned_fish","sashimi_fish","xy_wing","xyz_wing","simple_coloring","xy_chain","als_xz","general_fish","franken_fish","mutant_fish","multi_fin_fish","endo_fish","cannibalistic_fish","siamese_fish","aic","x_chain","grouped_aic","nice_loops","grouped_nice_loops","x_cycles","turbot_fish","skyscraper","two_string_kite","empty_rectangle","w_wing","multi_coloring","medusa","als_xz_extended","doubly_linked_als","als_chains","als_xy_wing","death_blossom","bent_subsets","wxyz_wing","sue_de_coq","aligned_pair_exclusion","aligned_triple_exclusion","templates","pattern_overlay","nishio","proof_regions","complete_support","forcing_chains","forcing_nets","kraken_fish","kraken_type2"],"expert_limits":{"max_board_size":16,"max_network_cores":100000,"max_domain_values":1000000,"max_steps":100000,"max_patterns":64,"max_subset_size":4,"max_fish_size":4,"max_chain_length":8,"max_als_size":3,"max_als_sets":128,"max_petals":4,"max_graph_nodes":2048,"max_graph_edges":16384,"max_group_size":3,"max_coloring_nodes":32,"max_net_categories":24,"max_net_radius":3,"max_cores":256,"max_work":10000000,"max_planning_steps":10000000,"max_size":1000000,"max_output_size":100000,"max_cache_entries":128},"note":"Exploratory reuse of the same16 reserved puzzles, no training/checkpoint selection. Compare ordinary MAC, cycle8 heuristic, cycle12 control, and cycle8 with optional generic overlap/Hall proposals. Same generic candidate/step/core/output/tensor limits; enabled detector support reads are extra bounded preparation, so equal caps are not equal compute. All three structural arms use the SAME refreshed policy: regenerate after useful contraction, cache only no-op input snapshots. The expert has its own larger limits and is a separate reference. Complete MAC solving with name tie-break; summaries temporary, normal reversible domains. Time includes initial GAC, proposal setup and solver work, excludes network/state creation and final validation; concurrent single-thread CPU workers. Useful new-rule applications record exact pre/post domains and original cores for independent branch-snapshot replay; their protected transactions include trace capture, so a pending guard can overshoot one bounded application. Trace overhead is included in solving time. An unqueried pre-trace protocol is retained separately; all final settings are frozen before this study's queries. Frozen training sources untouched."}
